Pour upon us Thy Love and Thy Light, give sustenance to our bodies, hearts and souls, use us for the purpose that Thy Wisdom chooseth, and guide us on the path of Thine Own Goodness.<br />
Draw us closer to Thee every moment of our life, until in us be reflected Thy Grace,Thy Glory,Thy Wisdom,Thy Joy and Thy Peace.<br />
