		<description><![CDATA[Edouard was a dear friend of mine.
When I first arrived at The Abode in 1979, Edouard introduced me to The Abode, to the people and to Sufism.  He showed me the ropes.  We spent many days together delivering and installing wood stoves for our boss Subhan Hamilton, who managed The Wood Stove Store in New Lebanon.
Later I lived with Edouard and his wonderful wife Savitri at Andy and June Ross&#039;s farm.

Edouard Gauthier:
He was never in a hurry
He was never stingy
He cheered me up when I was down
He explained cool stuff to me

We are going to have a great time in Heaven!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Edouard was a dear friend of mine.<br />
When I first arrived at The Abode in 1979, Edouard introduced me to The Abode, to the people and to Sufism.  He showed me the ropes.  We spent many days together delivering and installing wood stoves for our boss Subhan Hamilton, who managed The Wood Stove Store in New Lebanon.<br />
Later I lived with Edouard and his wonderful wife Savitri at Andy and June Ross&#8217;s farm.</p>
<p>Edouard Gauthier:<br />
He was never in a hurry<br />
He was never stingy<br />
He cheered me up when I was down<br />
He explained cool stuff to me</p>
<p>We are going to have a great time in Heaven!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
