		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=555#comment-15721</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Ah Edouard - what a wonderful, dear, and generous friend - and such a great sense of humor. I have so many found memories that are frequently triggered. I lived with him and Savitri for 6 months (virtually rent free) while finishing my graduate programme at the University of Baltimore. I was in dire straights with my living and financial situation when they invited me in; they provided great emotional support and made all the difference. I miss you dearly my friend.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ah Edouard &#8211; what a wonderful, dear, and generous friend &#8211; and such a great sense of humor. I have so many found memories that are frequently triggered. I lived with him and Savitri for 6 months (virtually rent free) while finishing my graduate programme at the University of Baltimore. I was in dire straights with my living and financial situation when they invited me in; they provided great emotional support and made all the difference. I miss you dearly my friend.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
