		<description><![CDATA[I knew Edouard for most of my life.  I was so young the last time I saw him that I don&#039;t have any specific memories, but I have this picture of him with a big, friendly smile.  The picture on top really says it all for me.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I knew Edouard for most of my life.  I was so young the last time I saw him that I don&#8217;t have any specific memories, but I have this picture of him with a big, friendly smile.  The picture on top really says it all for me.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
